        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>The mummy targets one creature it can see within 60 feet of it. If the target can see the mummy, it must succeed on a [[/save ability=wis dc=11]] saving throw against this magic or become &amp;Reference[condition=frightened] until the end of the mummy's next turn. If the target fails the saving throw by 5 or more, it is also &amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed] for the same duration. A target that succeeds on the saving throw is immune to the Dreadful Glare of all mummies (but not mummy lords) for the next 24 hours.</p></div>",
